    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yuda na Tamali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha itungo lyeni'lo, Yuda wav'alekaga v'adu'gu'ye, wayaga ku'kikala na muntu' yu'mo Mwadulami, lina lyakwe Hila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwenu'ko Yuda wapomaga na mwaniki' wa Ki'kanaani, lina lyakwe witanagwe Shua. Wamusolaga na ku'mutoola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaniki' mwenu'yo wapandi'kaga mwitungo, na wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya. Yuda wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Eli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wapandi'kaga mwitungo, wav'yalaga mwana yu'ngi' wa ki'gosya, na wamupaga lina Onani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wav'yalaga mwana yu'ngi' wa ki'gosya, wamupaga lina Shela. Itungo lya ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Shela, Yuda wav'age ku' lwandi' lwa Kezibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda wamutozyaga Eli, muv'yalwa wakwe wa mbele, ku' muki'ma u'yo witanagwe lina lyakwe Tamali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Eli, muv'yalwa wa mbele wamwa Yuda, wav'age mukenagu'zi ha minso gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na ku'nguno yeni'yo Mulungu wamuwu'lagaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yuda wamuwi'laga Onani ati', “U'mwingi'le muki' wa muyagi mudu'gu'yo, ku'nguno yi'li'ku'dima u'v'ezye vyeni'vyo, u'muv'yali'le muku'lu'yo, ki'gele apandi'ke wu'v'yalwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Onani wav'age amanyile ku'v'a wu'v'yalwa wenu'wo wu'kasye wu'v'e wakwe. Ku'nguno yeni'yo wav'age u'lu' walala na muki' wa muku'lu'ye, mbiyu' zyakwe witi'lage ha nsi', ki'gele aleke ku'muv'yali'la muku'lu'ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igambo lyeni'lo wav'ezyage Onani, lyav'age lya wu'kenagu'zi ha minso gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno yeni'yo nawe wamuwu'lagaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yuda wamuwi'laga mukamwana wakwe Tamali ati', “U'su'v'e ku' lu'go lwinywe ku'mwa so, u'kav'e mufwi'lwa mpaka mwana wanne Shela aho alav'e waku'la.” Yuda wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno ya kwiganika ku'v'a Shela nawe akowolile ku'fwa ki'ti' v'aku'lu'ye. Hohene Tamali wasu'v'aga ku'mwa ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyav'i'ta itungo ilihu, muki' wamwa Yuda wagulalaga. Yav'aga Yuda aho wamalaga ku'muli'la muki' wakwe, wayaga ku' Timuna haki'mo na munwaniye Hila, Mwadulami, ku' v'antu' av'o v'av'age v'ali'zisu'nzu'la nkolo zyakwe woya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga aho Tamali wigagwa ati', ise wu'kwi ali' mu nzi'la ku'ya ku' Timuna ku'kazisu'nzu'la woya nkolo zyakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hohene wazulaga myenda zya wu'fwi'lwa wakwe, na wikumbi'laga wu'shungi, ki'gele v'aleke ku'mumanya. Haho wayaga bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Enaimu, bi'hi' na nzi'la i'yo yi'yile ku' Timuna. Tamali wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno wawonaga ku'v'a Shela wav'aga muntu' muhanya, ali'vi v'akamusaazizye ku' wakwe ki'gele av'e mugosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yuda wamuwona, wiganikaga ku'v'a muki'ma mwenu'yu' mulav'a, ku'nguno wikumbi'laga wu'syu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamanyile ku'v'a ali' mukamwana wakwe. Hohene wamwegelaga henanho ha mpelo na nzi'la, wamuwi'laga ati', “Izu'u' gi'si', nu'togwa ku'lala nanho.” Tamali wamuwu'zyaga ati', “U'lu' nzumye ku'lala nanho u'ku'mpa ki'?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nku'ku'tu'mi'la kadi'lana ka mbu'li ku'fuma mu idale lyanne.” Tamali wamuwi'laga, “Tu'u'la mulehani gwa ku'mbezya nsani'zye ku'v'a nhana u'lantu'mi'le kadi'lana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yuda wamuwu'zyaga, “U'li'koov'a nku'pe ki'ntu' ki'?” Nawe wasu'v'yaga, “Mpage gwenu'go mukufu u'go gu'li' na muhuli gwako haki'mo na mulanga u'go u'dimile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yuda wamupaga vintu' vyeni'vyo vyose, na ku'lala nawe. Haho Tamali wapandi'kaga mwitungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Tamali wawu'kaga na ku'su'v'a ku' lu'go, wazulaga wu'shungi wakwe, wazwalaga hangi' myenda zyakwe zya wu'fwi'lwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga itungo i'lo Yuda wamutu'maga munwaniye Hila, Mwadulami, afile kadi'lana kenako, ki'gele asu'v'ye vintu' vyakwe ku'fuma ku' mwenu'yo muki'ma, ali'vi mwenu'yo munwaniye akamusangile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hila wav'awu'zyaga v'ikazi v'a ha Enaimu, “Ali' ku'he muki'ma mulav'a u'yo ali'v'aga ha mpelo na nzi'la bi'hi' na henanha?” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga, “Henanha hakav'aga na muki'ma mulav'a.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hila wasu'v'aga ku'mwa Yuda, wamuwi'laga ati', “Nkamuwine, na v'ikazi v'a henanho v'ambwi'laga ati', ‘Hakav'aga na muki'ma mulav'a henanha.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda wayombaga, “Leka avisole vintu' vyeni'vyo, ku'du' kwize ku'pondwensoni. Ev'e mweni'ki'li' wawonaga ku'v'a namufili'laga kadi'lana, ali'vi u'kamusangile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyav'i'taga itungo lya myezi idatu', Yuda wapandi'kaga mmola ku'v'a, “Kasinaga mukamwana wako Tamali wav'aga mulav'a, ku'nguno yeni'yo wapandi'kaga mwitungo!” Hohene Yuda wafumyaga ilagi'li'zyo ati', “Mumufumye ha ibala akatimwe moto mpaka afwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho v'av'age v'ali'mufumya ha ibala, Tamali watu'maga nkombe ku'mwa ise wu'kwi na ku'yomba ati', “Musav'a vintu' i'vi hu' mwene wampile mwitungo. Ku'nguno yeni'yo, nu'ku'lomba u'mumanye musav'a vintu' i'vi: mukufu, muhuli haki'mo na mulanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yuda wavimanyaga vintu' vyeni'vyo, na wayombaga ati', “Tamali ali' wa lole ku'ki'la ene, ku'nguno nkamupile mwana wanne Shela, ki'gele amutoole.” Ku'fuma henanho akalalile nawe hangi'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga aho lyafikaga itungo lya ku'v'yala kwamwa Tamali, yamanyi'kaga, kasinaga ali' na mav'asa mu nda yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wav'age ali'v'yala, mwana yu'mo wafumyaga mukono gwakwe ha ibala, hohene mwingi' wasolaga wu'zi wazaa na ku'mutunga mwana mwenu'yo ku' mukono gwakwe, nawe wayombaga ati', “Mwenu'yu' hu' watongelaga ku'v'yalwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi aho wagu'su'v'yaga mukono gwakwe mugati', kasinaga mudu'gu'ye watongelaga ku'fuma! Mwingi' wayombaga ati', “Yav'a vihe wafuma ku' nguzu ev'e?” Ku'nguno yeni'yo v'amupaga lina Pelezi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Pelezi” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ku'fuma ku' nguzu.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho wav'yalagwa mudu'gu'ye atungilwe wu'zi wazaa ku' mukono gwakwe, nawe witanagwa lina Zela",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Zela” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “mwanga gwazaa gwa ikingilima.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
